{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setDisposeFunction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"dispose"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GSourceDisposeFunc","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@GSourceDisposeFunc"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dispose"},{"type":"text","text":" function will be called once the reference count of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches zero but before any of the state of the source is freed, especially"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the finalize function (set as part of the [type"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/SourceFuncs"},{"type":"text","text":"]) is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This means that at this point "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" is still a valid [struct"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/Source"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and it is allow for the reference count to increase again until "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dispose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dispose function can be used to clear any ‘weak’ references to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" in other data structures 